# Files/folders the agent should NEVER read into context for record-entry
# or PO-ingestion tasks. Add this pattern list wherever your agy config
# reads ignore rules from (check ~/.gemini/settings.json "ignore" or
# "contextExclude" key, or an .aiexclude / .geminiignore file if agy
# supports one directly).

node_modules/
extracted_po_images/
backups/
ops_backup/
render-dashboard/
*.log
*.log.*
ALL_SOURCE_CODE_FOR_AUDIT.txt
secretary_activity.log
supervisor.log
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
files.zip
fixed-files.zip
agymemory/
cloud_secretary/
